    "For the words “morning” and “evening” and reminders without a time": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لكلمتي «صباحًا» و«مساءً» وللتذكيرات بلا ساعة"
          }
